Description:

JMAP Email/get, Email/parse and SearchSnippet/get follow RFC 8621 more
closely.  SearchSnippet attachments and the imageSize and isDeleted body
properties now need https://cyrusimap.org/ns/jmap/mail in using.


Documentation:

RFC 8621 sections 4.1, 4.2, 4.9 and 5.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients requesting the imageSize or isDeleted body properties, or
SearchSnippet attachments, must include https://cyrusimap.org/ns/jmap/mail
in using.


GitHub issue:

None.
